`0..6` the Cartan elements `H_i = [E_i, F_i]`, then the 126 root vectors with weights `wt` (simple-root
coordinates; `CartanMatrix.E₇` ordering, which is the certificate's).  `sL` is the cert's structure-constant
table (sparse rows, one definition per row).  `modelL` is the bracket table of the rescaled lattice basis
`x_i = α_i(-1)𝟙`, `x_a = u_a f(wt a) e^{wt a}` of `(V_{E₇})₁` computed with the explicit cocycle
`ε' = (-1)^{ep}`; the files `E7LieModel*` check, row by row, that it is the cert table.  Generated by the
certificate-generation scripts.
-/

